### 2. Configuration ✅
- **Framework**: React 19.1.0 with Vite 7.0.4
- **Implementation File**: `frontend/src/main.jsx`
- **Import Statement**: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/react"`
- **Component Placement**: Inside the React.StrictMode and BrowserRouter, after the App component (line 23)

### 3. Implementation Details
The Analytics component is correctly placed at the root level of the application:
```javascript
ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById("root")).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <BrowserRouter>
      <ThemeProvider>
        <AuthProvider>
          <SidebarProvider>
            <ToastProvider>
              <App />
              <Analytics />  // ✅ Correctly placed here
            </ToastProvider>
          </SidebarProvider>
        </AuthProvider>
      </ThemeProvider>
    </BrowserRouter>
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

